    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1401">

                <pb facs="1242" n="984" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg984"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 367.116/341</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of the American Board of Commissioners for
                        Foreign Missions</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Rev. James L. Barton</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Clifton Springs, N. Y.</hi></placeName>,
                            <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1915-07-14T15:45:00-05:00"
                            notBefore="1915-07-10T00:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >undated</hi></date>.<lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received July 14,
                            1915, 3:45 p. m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Advices from different parts of Turkey report inhuman treatment of
                        Americans<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1401-f1"/> by Turks. Cannot something be
                    done to alleviate the horrors?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">James L. Barton</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1401-f1" n="1" xml:id="d1401-f1-content">
                <p>According to letter dated July 22, this should read “Armenians” (File No.
                    367.116/345).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
